title: Getting Ready
files:
  - .assets/img-100-01-01.png
  - .assets/img-100-01-02.png
  - em.prog:em.examples.basic/Ex01_HelloP.em.ts
  - em.prog:em.examples.basic/Ex02_BlinkerP.em.ts

steps:
  - cmds:
    text: |

      {[ht,$start]&thinsp;Welcome Aboard}

      This initial tour has two primary objectives:

      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]} Learning how to use the **TOUR GUIDE**.

      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]} Tweaking the UI to remove some visual clutter.

      To proceed through the current tour, you'll use the six buttons across the top of this view:

      {[DC,1]} **Refresh** &ndash; replay the current stop on this tour<br>
      {[DC,2]} **Restart** &ndash; rewind to the first stop on this tour <br>
      {[DC,3]} **Back** &ndash; go to the previous stop on this tour<br>
      {[DC,4]} **Next** &ndash; go to the next stop on this tour<br>
      {[DC,5]} **Screenshot** &ndash; save a screenshot of the this stop<br>
      {[DC,6]} **End** &ndash; stop this tour and close the **TOUR GUIDE**<br>

      Click the **Next** button to continue with **Tour&thinsp;01**&thinsp;....

  - cmds:
      - view 1
    text: |

      {[ht,household_supplies]&thinsp;Tidying Up &ndash; Activity Bar}

      You can remove some extraneous elements from the **Activity Bar** at the left of the **VS Code** window.

      Right-click inside the **Activity Bar** and uncheck the items suggested in the screenshot.

      We also moved the **EM&bull;Browser** and **EM&bull;Tours** activities to the top and bottom &ndash; for easy reference.

      {[in]To zoom in&thinsp;&middot;&thinsp;out within the image's editor tab, press <b>Ctrl</b> (or <b>Cmd</b>) while scrolling your mouse down&thinsp;&middot;&thinsp;up.}

      Suggestions only &ndash; click **Next** and let's keep moving&thinsp;....

  - cmds:
      - view 2
    text: |

      {[ht,household_supplies]&thinsp;Tidying Up &ndash; Outline View}

      You should place the **Outline View** in the **Secondary Side Bar** &ndash; even if it has nothing to show.

      The **Outline View** proves invaluable once we start exploring some **EM&bull;Script** source code.

      {[DC,1]} select **View > Open View** from the main menu<br>
      {[DC,2]} type `Outline` to locate then `<ENTER>` to open<br>
      {[DC,3]} drag the **OUTLINE** tab to the **Secondary Side Bar**<br>
      {[DC,4]} drop the **OUTLINE** tab just below **CHAT**<br>

      Again, suggestions only &ndash; click **Next** to continue&thinsp;....

  - cmds:
    text: |

      {[ht,$steps]&thinsp;Next Steps}

      Congratulations on completing your first tour.&thinsp;🎉

      After you **End** this tour by clicking the red square, we'll show the **EM&bull;TOURS** view in the **Primary Side Bar**.

      From here, proceed to the next tour in the **Orientation** bundle by clicking (once) on **Content Hierarchy**.

      And after completing **Content Hierarchy** and then **Language Surface**, have fun with the **Basic Examples**.

      {[hc]}
